// Unsigned transactions captured 2026-10-25 from Jupiter's public API (lite-api.jup.ag),
// built for a public exchange wallet. Nothing was signed or sent; every value is public
// on-chain data. These are the shapes real Jupiter answers take, so a guard that
// refuses any of them would refuse real trades. Swaps were built the way the site
// builds them: instructionVersion V2, the venue's 0.5% fee to its own fee account
// (the vault's ATA), wrapAndUnwrapSol, the 0.005 SOL priority cap.

